2️⃣ API Server receives the request and validates the YAML.

3️⃣ The request is stored in etcd (the Kubernetes database).

4️⃣ The Scheduler checks available nodes and selects one based on:

Resource requests

Taints & tolerations

Node affinity

etc.

5️⃣ Once a node is selected, the Kubelet on that node:

Talks to Container Runtime (like containerd/Docker)

Pulls the image

Creates the container

6️⃣ Readiness & liveness probes start checking health

7️⃣ If all is well, the Pod is marked Ready and traffic begins routing to it! ✅


